<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sunglass upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sunglass upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Securities said analyst Alice Ruth upgraded Sunglass Hut International Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- earlier Sunglass posted a 7.8 percent rise in its July same store sales and said its plans for reducing inventory levels and debt are running on schedule, helped in part by the summer movie hit &quot;Men In Black.&quot;</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1-5/16 to 9-3/4.</p>
</text>
